#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:904
msgid "DirectX Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:906
msgid ""
"`clang-dxc` and HLSL support are now enabled by default, following the "
"promotion of the DirectX backend to an official LLVM target."
msgstr ""

